    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nWhen building with `-DENABLE_WASMTIME=ON` on branch release-0.12, there is a mismatch between the required version (36.0.6 [`src/nvim/CMakeLists.txt:56`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/8aadd711870f2abf2fd03c82b1eebfc1b7c0c3c1/src/nvim/CMakeLists.txt#L56)), and the bundled version (36.0.12 [`cmake.deps/deps.txt:L49`](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/8aadd711870f2abf2fd03c82b1eebfc1b7c0c3c1/cmake.deps/deps.txt#L49))\n\nError message:\n```\nCMake Error at /usr/share/cmake/Modules/FindPackageHandleStandardArgs.cmake:290 (message):\n  Could NOT find Wasmtime: Found unsuitable version \"36.0.1\", but required is\n  exact version \"36.0.6\" (found /tmp/neovim/.deps/usr/include)\nCall Stack (most recent call first):\n  /usr/share/cmake/Modules/FindPackageHandleStandardArgs.cmake:652 (_FPHSA_FAILURE_MESSAGE)\n  cmake/FindWasmtime.cmake:9 (find_package_handle_standard_args)\n  src/nvim/CMakeLists.txt:56 (find_package)\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```\n# Branch release-0.12\nREV=8aadd711870f2abf2fd03c82b1eebfc1b7c0c3c1\ngit clone --revision=\"$REV\" --depth=1 https://github.com/neovim/neovim.git\ncd neovim\nmake CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release DEPS_CMAKE_FLAGS='-DENABLE_WASMTIME=ON' CMAKE_EXTRA_FLAGS='-DENABLE_WASMTIME=ON'\n```\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n1. Should detect the correct version\n    - As you can see in the error message, it detected version 36.0.1, rather than 36.0.12\n2. It should accept version 36.0.12, since it is just a patch release difference from 36.0.6\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\n0.12.0 commit 8aadd711870f2abf2fd03c82b1eebfc1b7c0c3c1\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nN/A\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nFedora Linux 44\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nN/A\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nN/A\n\n### Installation\n\nBuilt from source (with `-DENABLE_WASMTIME`)",
